  <item>
    <title>10.现在刷小红书也需要这么深的城府了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67305919f373fe5d4d10f08f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67305919f373fe5d4d10f08f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Nov 2024 07:14:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 打破信息茧房，与小红书算法斗智斗勇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> 进入在网上“找骂”的小孩哥与小孩姐的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 好奇心有高低之分吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 纷扰的噪音还是生活的参与感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 我需要别人不断的challenge我，才能获得立体的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 当一个东西太火了，是不是就该敲响警钟了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">32:35</a> P P T 式聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 当我发现自己变得不深刻了，是该关心宇宙，还是该关心今天中午吃什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 周边来啦，2025年的手绘月历～～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎移步xhs📖账号</span></p><span></span><p><span>弗莱：个个了一 （99427851335） 链接在弗莱主页：和好朋友们一起做了本月历&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>沫儿莓徳：沫儿莓徳 is reading📖 （384051648）</span></p><span></span><p><span>猴姐：奔跑的小猴姐 （7158629790）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhXQZxEuLpfgSk7wF_A2pD85mMjl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fik4CkUgHuXXnkXT4VEIXU2AFjis.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUXYfOL4Zr98oNMuYNuNhMBMDJW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fua3_w6s_0m-MHEmIqSiI4Vvk-Sp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
